ay to invite or join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/11d968489a654d159056f163629e5559.poster.avif?t=1762406299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/11d968489a654d159056f163629e5559.webm?t=1762406299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/11d968489a654d159056f163629e5559.mp4?t=1762406299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/d4889d58e77a1a9377c2842c38776de4.webp?t=1762406299\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add products to your shopping cart via the mobile tablet, place an order and await the delivery truck! Make sure storage racks are assigned so restockers can move inventory around.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/26e9a4108669983eb344ae8c02c7e52e.poster.avif?t=1762406299\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/26e9a4108669983eb344ae8c02c7e52e.webm?t=1762406299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203280/extras/26e9a4108669983eb344ae8c02c7e52e.mp4?t=1762406299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" s